# Bootstrap scheduler test: two workers sleeping different spans.
# The short sleeper must finish first although it was spawned second
# (cooperative scheduling, timer event queue on the logical tick).
# Print order 1 2 12 2 11 1 proves the interleave: worker 2 prints
# its post-sleep line (12) before worker 1 (11), and each await
# returns the finishing worker's own value.
worker(r): n delay [
    print(_): n
    sleep(_): delay
    add(r2): n 10
    print(_): r2
    set(r): n
]

init(ret): arg_cnt arg_vec [
    async(p1): "worker" 1 50
    async(p2): "worker" 2 10
    yield(_): 0
    await(a2): p2
    print(_): a2
    await(a1): p1
    print(_): a1
    set(ret): 0
]
